{"id":28,"role":"Tool","content":"C:\\github\\YangMills\\src\\lean\\YangMills\\Proofs\\ReflectionPositivity.lean\n-- 1664 lines, 102364 bytes --\n1430 | 1. The plaquette Boltzmann factor `exp(c·Re Tr(g₁g₂g₃g₄))` is a\n1431 |    positive-definite function on `SU(N)⁴` — this is proved (from the\n1432 |    Peter-Weyl / Clebsch-Gordan axiom) in `PeterWeyl.lean` as\n1433 |    `plaquetteBoltzmannPD`.\n1434 | 2. Positive-definiteness of the plaquette factor implies that the transfer\n1435 |    matrix `T` (which integrates out the negative-time links with the\n1436 |    reflection kernel) is a positive operator on `L²(SU(N)^{interface})`.\n1437 | 3. The identity `∫ G(U)·G(θU) dμ₀ = ∫ g(u)·(Tg)(u) dμ⁺⁰` (proved in\n1438 |    `TransferMatrix.lean` as `integral_G_thetaG_eq_inner_g_Tg`) then gives\n1439 |    `∫ G·G(θU) ≥ 0` from the positivity of `T`.\n1440 | \n1441 | Steps 2–3 require the full transfer-matrix construction (measure-theoretic\n1442 | factorization of the product Haar measure, Fubini, and the character-expansion\n1443 | argument).  The positive-definiteness of the plaquette factor (step 1) is the\n1444 | key input and is proved in `PeterWeyl.lean`; the remaining measure theory is\n1445 | axiomatized here.  See `docs/found_issues.md` §3 and `docs/gap_analysis.md`. -/\n1446 | axiom transferMatrixPositivity_axiom (N T L : ℕ) (β : ℝ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n1447 |     (hT : Odd T) (f : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L) → ℝ)\n1448 |     (hf_supported : dependsOnlyOnPosInterface N T L f) :\n1449 |     0 ≤ ∫ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L)\n1450 |         (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n1451 |       osG N T L β f\n1452 |         (extendLinkVariable N (PeriodicSite T L)\n1453 |           (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) cfg) *\n1454 |       osG N T L β f\n1455 |         (reflectLinkVariable N\n1456 |           (extendLinkVariable N (PeriodicSite T L)\n1457 |             (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) cfg))\n1458 |       ∂ productHaarMeasure N (PeriodicSite T L)\n1459 |         (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))\n1460 | \n1461 | lemma gibbsExpectationPeriodic_reflection_positive (N T L : ℕ) (β : ℝ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n1462 |     (hT : Odd T) (f : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L) → ℝ)\n1463 |     (hf_supported : dependsOnlyOnPosInterface N T L f) :\n1464 |     0 ≤ gibbsExpectation N β (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))\n1465 |       (λ U => f U * reflectObservable N f U) := by\n1466 |   dsimp [gibbsExpectation]\n1467 |   have hZ_pos : partitionFunctionFinite N β (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) > 0 :=\n1468 |     partitionFunctionFinite_pos N β (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))\n1469 |   refine div_nonneg ?_ (le_of_lt hZ_pos)\n1470 |   set μ₀ := productHaarMeasure N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) with hμ₀\n1471 |   set S_total := wilsonActionFiniteConfig N β (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) with hS\n1472 |   set U_ext := extendLinkVariable N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) with hU\n1473 |   have h_total_decomp : ∀ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n1474 |       S_total cfg = wilsonActionOSPositive N T L β (U_ext cfg) +\n1475 |         wilsonActionOSNegative N T L β (U_ext cfg) +\n1476 |         wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) := by\n1477 |     intro cfg\n1478 |     calc\n1479 |       S_total cfg = wilsonActionFinite N β (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) (U_ext cfg) := rfl\n1480 |       _ = wilsonActionOSPositive N T L β (U_ext cfg) +\n1481 |           wilsonActionOSNegative N T L β (U_ext cfg) +\n1482 |           wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) :=\n1483 |         total_decomposition_os_periodic N T L β (U_ext cfg)\n1484 |   have h_neg_reflect : ∀ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n1485 |       wilsonActionOSNegative N T L β (U_ext cfg) =\n1486 |       wilsonActionOSPositive N T L β (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) := by\n1487 |     intro cfg\n1488 |     exact neg_action_reflection_os_periodic N T L β hT (U_ext cfg)\n1489 |   have h_int_reflect : ∀ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n1490 |       wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) =\n1491 |       wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) := by\n1492 |     intro cfg\n1493 |     exact interface_action_reflection_symmetric_os_periodic N T L β hT (U_ext cfg)\n1494 |   have h_factorization : ∀ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n1495 |       Real.exp (-β * S_total cfg) = \n1496 |       (Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSPositive N T L β (U_ext cfg)) *\n1497 |         Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) / 2)) *\n1498 |       (Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSPositive N T L β (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg))) *\n1499 |         Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) / 2)) := by\n1500 |     intro cfg\n1501 |     rw [h_total_decomp cfg]\n1502 |     have h_mul : -β * (wilsonActionOSPositive N T L β (U_ext cfg) + wilsonActionOSNegative N T L β (U_ext cfg) +\n1503 |       wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg)) = \n1504 |       (-β * wilsonActionOSPositive N T L β (U_ext cfg)) + \n1505 |       (-β * wilsonActionOSNegative N T L β (U_ext cfg)) + \n1506 |       (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg)) := by ring\n1507 |     rw [h_mul]\n1508 |     rw [Real.exp_add, Real.exp_add]\n1509 |     rw [h_neg_reflect cfg, h_int_reflect cfg]\n1510 |     have h_exp_split : Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg)) =\n1511 |       Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) / 2) *\n1512 |       Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) / 2) := by\n1513 |       calc\n1514 |         Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg)) =\n1515 |           Real.exp ((-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) / 2) +\n1516 |                    (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) / 2)) := by ring\n1517 |         _ = Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) / 2) *\n1518 |             Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) / 2) := by rw [Real.exp_add]\n1519 |     rw [h_exp_split]\n1520 |     ring\n1521 |   set G := osG N T L β f with hG\n1522 |   have h_integrand_eq : ∀ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n1523 |       f (U_ext cfg) * f (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) *\n1524 |       Real.exp (-β * S_total cfg) =\n1525 |       G (U_ext cfg) * G (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) := by\n1526 |     intro cfg\n1527 |     dsimp [G, osG]\n1528 |     rw [h_factorization cfg]\n1529 |     ring\n1530 |   have h_fun_eq : (λ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))) =>\n1531 |       f (U_ext cfg) * f (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) * Real.exp (-β * S_total cfg)) =\n1532 |     (λ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))) =>\n1533 |       G (U_ext cfg) * G (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg))) := by\n1534 |     ext cfg; exact h_integrand_eq cfg\n1535 |   calc\n1536 |     (∫ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n1537 |       f (U_ext cfg) * f (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) * Real.exp (-β * S_total cfg) ∂ μ₀)\n1538 |         = (∫ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n1539 |       G (U_ext cfg) * G (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) ∂ μ₀) := by\n1540 |       rw [h_fun_eq]\n1541 |     _ ≥ 0 := by\n1542 |       -- GOAL: Prove that ∫ G(U)·G(θU) dμ₀(U) ≥ 0.\n1543 |       -- The positivity follows from `transferMatrixPositivity_axiom`, which is\n1544 |       -- justified by `plaquetteBoltzmannPD` (Peter-Weyl / Clebsch-Gordan) ⟹\n1545 |       -- transfer matrix T positive ⟹ ∫ G·G(θU) ≥ 0.  See the axiom's docstring.\n1546 |       exact transferMatrixPositivity_axiom N T L β hT f hf_supported\n1547 | \n1548 | /-! ## Clean factorization and the PD-structure obstruction\n1549 | \n1550 | The reflection-positivity integrand `osG(U) · osG(θU)` factorizes cleanly as\n1551 | `f(U) · f(θU) · exp(-β S_W(U))` (lemma `osG_thetaG_factorization` below).\n1552 | This shows that the axiom `transferMatrixPositivity_axiom` is equivalent to:\n1553 | \n1554 |     ∫ f(U) · f(θU) · exp(-β S_W(U)) dμ₀ ≥ 0\n1555 | \n1556 | where `exp(-β S_W)` is the full Boltzmann factor, proved positive-definite on the\n1557 | full link-variable group by `boltzmannFactorPD` (in `BoltzmannFactor.lean`).\n1558 | \n1559 | **Key obstruction**: this integral is NOT the standard positive-definite quadratic\n\n... 105 more line(s) below (use offset=1560 to continue reading)","timestamp":1785483870,"token_count":2775,"tool_call_id":"cba2d209-6cc7-4ca6-9bb2-1696864ebc23","full_token_estimate":1821,"tool_meta":{"tool_name":"read_file","file_path":"src/lean/YangMills/Proofs/ReflectionPositivity.lean","old_text":null,"new_text":null,"exit_code":null,"line_count":1664,"byte_count":102364,"is_error":false,"duration_ms":0,"edit_line":null},"turn":16,"is_prune_marker":false}
{"id":29,"role":"Tool","content":"C:\\github\\YangMills\\src\\lean\\YangMills\\Proofs\\TransferMatrix.lean\n-- 2973 lines, 109419 bytes --\n1960 | #print axioms transferMatrix_integrand_change_of_variables\n1961 | \n1962 | /-- The transfer matrix after the change of variables `U⁻ ↦ V⁺ = reflectNegToPos(U⁻)`.\n1963 | \n1964 | After applying `reflectLinkVariable_measurePreserving_between` (with\n1965 | `sourceSites = negativeSites`, `targetSites = positiveSites`) and the pointwise\n1966 | identity `transferMatrix_integrand_change_of_variables`, the transfer matrix\n1967 | becomes:\n1968 | \n1969 |     (Tψ)(u) = exp(-β·S⁺(u)/2) · ∫_{V⁺} ψ(V⁺, σ(u⁰)) ·\n1970 |               exp(-β·(S⁺(V⁺, σ(u⁰))/2 + S_int(U⁺, u⁰, reflect(V⁺)))) dμ⁺(V⁺)\n1971 | \n1972 | This is the \"reflected\" form of the transfer matrix, where the negative-time\n1973 | integral has been replaced by a positive-time integral via the measure-preserving\n1974 | reflection. -/\n1975 | noncomputable def transferMatrixReflected (ψ : PosInterfaceConfig N T L → ℝ)\n1976 |     (u : PosInterfaceConfig N T L) : ℝ :=\n1977 |   let S_plus := osPositiveOfPosInterface N T L β u\n1978 |   ∫ (V_plus : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (positiveSites T L)),\n1979 |     ψ (mergePosInterface N T L V_plus (sigmaInterface N T L (restrictToInterface N T L u))) *\n1980 |     Real.exp (-β * (S_plus / 2 +\n1981 |       osPositiveOfPosInterface N T L β\n1982 |         (mergePosInterface N T L V_plus (sigmaInterface N T L (restrictToInterface N T L u))) / 2 +\n1983 |       wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β\n1984 |         (extendToFullConfig N T L (reflectPosToNeg N T L V_plus) u)))\n1985 |     ∂ haarMeasurePositive N T L\n1986 | \n1987 | set_option maxHeartbeats 1000000 in\n1988 | /-- The transfer matrix equals the reflected transfer matrix, via the change of\n1989 | variables `U⁻ ↦ V⁺ = reflectNegToPos(U⁻)`.\n1990 | \n1991 | This is the integral-level change of variables (sub-step 2 of step (b)). It applies\n1992 | `reflectLinkVariable_measurePreserving_between` (measure-preserving from μ⁻ to μ⁺)\n1993 | together with the pointwise identity `transferMatrix_integrand_change_of_variables`. -/\n1994 | lemma transferMatrix_change_of_variables (hT : Odd T)\n1995 |     (ψ : PosInterfaceConfig N T L → ℝ) (u : PosInterfaceConfig N T L)\n1996 |     (hψ_int : Integrable\n1997 |       (fun (V_plus : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (positiveSites T L)) =>\n1998 |         ψ (mergePosInterface N T L V_plus (sigmaInterface N T L (restrictToInterface N T L u))) *\n1999 |         Real.exp (-β * (osPositiveOfPosInterface N T L β u / 2 +\n2000 |           osPositiveOfPosInterface N T L β\n2001 |             (mergePosInterface N T L V_plus (sigmaInterface N T L (restrictToInterface N T L u))) / 2 +\n2002 |           wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β\n2003 |             (extendToFullConfig N T L (reflectPosToNeg N T L V_plus) u))))\n2004 |       (haarMeasurePositive N T L)) :\n2005 |     transferMatrixCorrect N T L β ψ u = transferMatrixReflected N T L β ψ u := by\n2006 |   -- The measure-preserving map: U⁻ ↦ V⁺ = reflectNegToPos(U⁻)\n2007 |   have hMP : MeasurePreserving (reflectNegToPos N T L)\n2008 |       (haarMeasureNegative N T L) (haarMeasurePositive N T L) := by\n2009 |     unfold haarMeasureNegative haarMeasurePositive reflectNegToPos\n2010 |     exact reflectLinkVariable_measurePreserving_between N\n2011 |       (negativeSites T L) (positiveSites T L)\n2012 |       (fun n hn => reflectSite_mem_positive_of_negative hT hn)\n2013 |       (fun n hn => reflectSite_mem_negative_of_positive hT hn)\n2014 |   -- Define the reflected integrand\n2015 |   set f_reflected := fun (V_plus : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (positiveSites T L)) =>\n2016 |     ψ (mergePosInterface N T L V_plus (sigmaInterface N T L (restrictToInterface N T L u))) *\n2017 |     Real.exp (-β * (osPositiveOfPosInterface N T L β u / 2 +\n2018 |       osPositiveOfPosInterface N T L β\n2019 |         (mergePosInterface N T L V_plus (sigmaInterface N T L (restrictToInterface N T L u))) / 2 +\n2020 |       wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β\n2021 |         (extendToFullConfig N T L (reflectPosToNeg N T L V_plus) u)))\n2022 |   -- Change of variables via integral_map + hMP.map_eq\n2023 |   -- integral_map gives: ∫ y, f y ∂(map g μ) = ∫ x, f (g x) ∂μ\n2024 |   -- So .symm gives: ∫ x, f (g x) ∂μ = ∫ y, f y ∂(map g μ)\n2025 |   have h_cov : ∫ (U_minus : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (negativeSites T L)),\n2026 |       f_reflected (reflectNegToPos N T L U_minus) ∂ haarMeasureNegative N T L =\n2027 |     ∫ (V_plus : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (positiveSites T L)),\n2028 |       f_reflected V_plus ∂ haarMeasurePositive N T L := by\n2029 |     rw [← hMP.map_eq]\n2030 |     have h_int : Integrable f_reflected\n2031 |         (Measure.map (reflectNegToPos N T L) (haarMeasureNegative N T L)) := by\n2032 |       rw [hMP.map_eq]; exact hψ_int\n2033 |     exact (integral_map hMP.measurable.aemeasurable h_int.aestronglyMeasurable).symm\n2034 |   -- The original integrand equals f_reflected(reflectNegToPos U⁻) pointwise\n2035 |   have h_ptwise : ∀ (U_minus : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (negativeSites T L)),\n2036 |       ψ (reflectToPosInterface N T L U_minus (restrictToInterface N T L u)) *\n2037 |       Real.exp (-β * (osPositiveOfPosInterface N T L β u / 2 +\n2038 |         wilsonActionOSNegative N T L β (extendToFullConfig N T L U_minus u) / 2 +\n2039 |         wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (extendToFullConfig N T L U_minus u))) =\n2040 |       f_reflected (reflectNegToPos N T L U_minus) :=\n2041 |     transferMatrix_integrand_change_of_variables N T L β hT ψ u\n2042 |   -- Assemble via calc: unfold → pointwise rewrite → change of variables → unfold\n2043 |   calc transferMatrixCorrect N T L β ψ u\n2044 |       = ∫ (U_minus : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (negativeSites T L)),\n2045 |           ψ (reflectToPosInterface N T L U_minus (restrictToInterface N T L u)) *\n2046 |           Real.exp (-β * (osPositiveOfPosInterface N T L β u / 2 +\n2047 |             wilsonActionOSNegative N T L β (extendToFullConfig N T L U_minus u) / 2 +\n2048 |             wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (extendToFullConfig N T L U_minus u)))\n2049 |           ∂ haarMeasureNegative N T L := by\n2050 |         unfold transferMatrixCorrect; dsimp only\n2051 |     _ = ∫ (U_minus : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (negativeSites T L)),\n2052 |           f_reflected (reflectNegToPos N T L U_minus) ∂ haarMeasureNegative N T L := by\n2053 |         congr 1; funext U_minus; exact h_ptwise U_minus\n2054 |     _ = ∫ (V_plus : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (positiveSites T L)),\n2055 |           f_reflected V_plus ∂ haarMeasurePositive N T L := h_cov\n2056 |     _ = transferMatrixReflected N T L β ψ u := by\n2057 |         unfold transferMatrixReflected; dsimp only\n2058 | \n2059 | #print axioms transferMatrix_change_of_variables\n2060 | \n2061 | lemma G_thetaG_factorization (f : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L) → ℝ)\n2062 | \n2063 |     (hf_supported : dependsOnlyOnPosInterface N T L f) (U : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L)) :\n2064 | \n2065 |     G N T L hT β f U * G N T L hT β f (reflectLinkVariable N U) =\n2066 | \n2067 |     g_posInterface N T L hT β f (restrictPosInterface N T L\n2068 | \n2069 |       (restrictLinkVariable N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) U)) *\n2070 | \n2071 |     g_posInterface N T L hT β f (reflectToPosInterface N T L\n2072 | \n2073 |       (restrictLinkVariable N (PeriodicSite T L) (negativeSites T L) U)\n2074 | \n2075 |       (restrictToInterface N T L (restrictPosInterface N T L\n2076 | \n2077 |         (restrictLinkVariable N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) U)))) *\n2078 | \n2079 |     Real.exp (-β * (osPositiveOfPosInterface N T L β\n\n... 894 more line(s) below (use offset=2080 to continue reading)","timestamp":1785483870,"token_count":2436,"tool_